cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use COWLS data, please cite the three COWLS papers: COWLS I
  (Nightingale et al. 2025, doi:10.1093/mnras/staf1253), COWLS II
  (Mahler et al. 2025, doi:10.1093/mnrasl/slaf088) and COWLS III
  (Hogg et al. 2025, doi:10.1093/mnras/staf1678). BibTeX entries are in
  CITATIONS.bib.
title: "The COSMOS-Web Lens Survey (COWLS): public data release"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Nightingale
    given-names: James W.
  - name: "The COSMOS-Web Lensing Science Working Group"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jammy2211/COWLS_COSMOS_Web_Lens_Survey"
url: "https://jammy2211.github.io/COWLS_COSMOS_Web_Lens_Survey/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - strong gravitational lensing
  - JWST
  - COSMOS-Web
  - PyAutoLens
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "The COSMOS-Web Lens Survey (COWLS) I: Discovery of >100 high redshift strong lenses in contiguous JWST imaging"
  authors:
